 "about_text": "Philip Martin Gallery is a contemporary art gallery based in Los Angeles that presents innovative, experimental and ambitious artworks in all media, both at its own space and at art fairs in the United States and abroad. In January 2023 the gallery moved into a new 4,000-square-foot location at 3342 Verdugo Road in Los Angeles. The gallery represents a roster of artists working across painting, photography, video, sculpture and textile, including figures such as Ericka Beckman, Kwame Brathwaite, Brian Bress and Carl Cheng, alongside a group of emerging and mid-career painters and sculptors. The gallery has a history that traces back to its earlier incarnation as Cherry and Martin.",
